Booking Agent System Prompt - English Version
==============================================
Master template that orchestrates all booking agent modules.

This template follows the modular architecture pattern:
- base.jinja2: Identity and services catalog
- modules/confirmation_flow.jinja2: Conversation workflow (A/B testable)
- modules/data_requirements.jinja2: Required booking data
- modules/examples.jinja2: Rules and formatting

A/B TEST EXPERIMENT SUPPORT
----------------------------
The confirmation_flow module supports A/B testing with parameter:
  show_pre_confirmation_summary (bool)

Version History:
  v1.0 (2025-10-11): Initial modular version
    - show_pre_confirmation_summary = false (Variant A - Direct confirmation)

  v1.1 (2025-10-11): Enhanced pre-confirmation flow
    - show_pre_confirmation_summary = true (Variant B - Summary before confirm)

Variables:
  - version (str): Template version identifier (v1.0, v1.1, etc.)
  - services (list): Available services from database or YAML
  - customer_email (str, optional): Current customer email
  - show_pre_confirmation_summary (bool): A/B test parameter for confirmation flow

Author: Lab01-MCP Team
Created: 2025-10-11
